,["ARC or PLC in Cumberland County","/arc-plc/maine/cumberland-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record from 1951 to 2025 shows May to June came in under 90% of normal in 39 of 75 years on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 11 grids. In 2025, July to August ran 44% of normal on the middle of the grids, and August to September ran 59%. Grid 28440 had its driest year in 1957 at 60% of normal.</p>"}
